    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/3/83280.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 14,
    "turn_text": "House Judiciary Chairman Jerry Nadler says that he expects Robert Mueller to have a quote unquote, profound impact when he testifies before Congress on July 17. The Judiciary and Intelligence Committees announced Tuesday that Mueller would be testifying in back-to-back hearings, though Mueller himself has said that he wouldn't provide any new information. President Trump reacted to the news Wednesday morning.",
