    "turn_idx": 15,
    "turn_text": "Now look, the balla thing never stops. There was no collusion. There was no obstruction. There was no nothing. How many times do we have to hear it? It never ends. It just keeps going on and on. I've been going through this for two years, two and a half years. And the criminal activity was on the other side. with the fake dossier, the phony fraudulent dossier, and all of the other things they've done, the Pfizer course, all of that, with the insurance policy by Stroke and his lover page. This is a disgraceful thing, and now we keep, I heard about it last night, and I just said, does it ever end? At what point does it end? It's a disgrace.",
