    "turn_text": "Well, Mueller has only spoken once publicly since embarking on his two-year investigation, which cleared President Trump of collusion with Russia and declined to say whether he ever obstructed justice. Mueller's testimony in Congress would be a key milestone in any democratic effort to impeach the president.",
