    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/3/83280.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 29,
    "turn_text": "you know, I love it when members of Congress spent a whole career doing something else that really weighs in on their political life. So I just wanted to ask you, how does being a dentist affect the way you approach healthcare as a major issue that you work on?",
