        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "A lack of inclusion in early policy-making leads to long-term systemic disadvantages.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker’s personal experience with dentistry provides valid insight into broader healthcare dynamics.",
        "confidence": 0.87
