    "turn_idx": 31,
    "turn_text": "Yeah. Well, we've had this ongoing health care debate in this country going back years and in 2017, we saw the repeal and replace effort. Barely fail in the Senate. Since then, what's your read on how things are going in Congress on the health care issue?",
